    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple controls, you try to master all the jumps and complete each level. If you don't manage a jump so well, you'll fall a long way behind, but maybe you'll make it the next time you try. The levels differ in length, difficulty, time pressure and the secrets you can find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With simple controls, you try to master all the jumps and complete each level. If you don't manage a jump so well, you'll fall a long way behind, but maybe you'll make it the next time you try. The levels differ in length, difficulty, time pressure and the secrets you can find.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Arcade Jumper is a simple but precise platformer in which you have to reach the finish line at the highest point of the level as quickly as possible. Whether you make it to the finish line is up to you.",
